msgid ""
msgstr ""
"# Architecture Design and Core Features\n"
"\n"
"## 1. Overall Architecture\n"
"\n"
"This system adopts a modular architecture design, with the core modules including: **Data Collection Module**, **Data Processing Module**, **Model Training Module**, **Inference Service Module**, and **Monitoring and Alerting Module**. Each module is decoupled through well-defined interfaces, supporting independent development, testing, and deployment.\n"
"\n"
"```\n"
"┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n"
"│                        Application Layer                      │\n"
"│  ┌─────────────┐  ┌─────────────┐  ┌─────────────┐          │\n"
"│  │  REST API   │  │  WebSocket  │  │   gRPC      │          │\n"
"│  └─────────────┘  └─────────────┘  └─────────────┘          │\n"
"└──────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┘\n"
"                           │\n"
"┌──────────────────────────▼──────────────────────────────────┐\n"
"│                      Service Layer                           │\n"
"│  ┌─────────────┐  ┌─────────────┐  ┌─────────────┐          │\n"
"│  │  Auth       │  │  Business   │  │  Data       │          │\n"
"│  │  Service    │  │  Logic      │  │  Validation │          │\n"
"│  └─────────────┘  └─────────────┘  └─────────────┘          │\n"
"└──────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┘\n"
"                           │\n"
"┌──────────────────────────▼──────────────────────────────────┐\n"
"│                      Data Layer                              │\n"
"│  ┌─────────────┐  ┌─────────────┐  ┌─────────────┐          │\n"
"│  │  MySQL      │  │  Redis      │  │  MongoDB    │          │\n"
"│  │  (Primary)  │  │  (Cache)    │  │  (Logs)     │          │\n"
"│  └─────────────┘  └─────────────┘  └─────────────┘          │\n"
"└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## 2. Core Feature Modules\n"
"\n"
"### 2.1 Data Collection Module\n"
"\n"
"The data collection module is responsible for acquiring data from multiple data sources, supporting both real-time streaming and batch processing modes.\n"
"\n"
"**Key Features:**\n"
"- Supports multiple data source access methods (Kafka, RabbitMQ, HTTP Webhook, etc.)\n"
"- Provides a unified data format conversion layer\n"
"- Implements data deduplication and integrity checks\n"
"- Supports dynamic configuration and hot updates of collection rules\n"
"\n"
"### 2.2 Data Processing Module\n"
"\n"
"The data processing module performs cleaning, transformation, and enrichment on raw data.\n"
"\n"
"**Processing Pipeline:**\n"
"1. **Data Cleaning**: Removes duplicate data, handles missing values, and filters abnormal data\n"
"2. **Data Transformation**: Standardizes formats, performs unit conversions, and encodes fields\n"
"3. **Data Enrichment**: Integrates external data sources to supplement missing information\n"
"4. **Data Aggregation**: Aggregates data based on business rules\n"
"\n"
"### 2.3 Model Training Module\n"
"\n"
"The model training module is responsible for the entire lifecycle management of machine learning models.\n"
"\n"
"**Training Process:**\n"
"- **Data Partitioning**: Automatically splits training, validation, and test sets\n"
"- **Feature Engineering**: Automated feature selection and extraction\n"
"- **Model Selection**: Supports multiple algorithm comparisons and automatic selection\n"
"- **Hyperparameter Optimization**: Uses Bayesian optimization or grid search\n"
"- **Model Evaluation**: Generates multi-dimensional evaluation reports\n"
"\n"
"### 2.4 Inference Service Module\n"
"\n"
"The inference service module provides online model inference capabilities with high availability and low latency.\n"
"\n"
"**Core Features:**\n"
"- **Multi-model Management**: Supports the concurrent deployment of multiple model versions\n"
"- **Dynamic Routing**: Routes requests based on business requirements\n"
"- **Load Balancing**: Automatically distributes requests across multiple instances\n"
"- **Graceful Scaling**: Supports elastic scaling based on traffic\n"
"\n"
"### 2.5 Monitoring and Alerting Module\n"
"\n"
"The monitoring and alerting module provides real-time monitoring of system status and automated alerting capabilities.\n"
"\n"
"**Monitoring Dimensions:**\n"
"- **System Metrics**: CPU, memory, disk, network I/O\n"
"- **Application Metrics**: Request volume, response time, error rate\n"
"- **Business Metrics**: Core business KPIs\n"
"- **Model Metrics**: Inference accuracy, latency, throughput\n"
"\n"
"## 3. Key Technical Features\n"
"\n"
"### 3.1 High Availability Design\n"
"\n"
"- **Service Redundancy**: All critical services are deployed with multiple replicas\n"
"- **Fault Isolation**: Implements circuit breaker and degradation mechanisms\n"
"- **Data Backup**: Supports multi-level backup and recovery strategies\n"
"- **Disaster Recovery**: Supports cross-data-center disaster recovery\n"
"\n"
"### 3.2 Performance Optimization\n"
"\n"
"- **Caching Strategy**: Multi-level caching (local cache, distributed cache)\n"
"- **Asynchronous Processing**: Uses message queues for asynchronous decoupling\n"
"- **Database Optimization**: Index optimization, read-write separation, sharding\n"
"- **Connection Pooling**: Efficient management of database and network connections\n"
"\n"
"### 3.3 Security Mechanisms\n"
"\n"
"- **Authentication and Authorization**: JWT-based authentication and RBAC permission control\n"
"- **Data Encryption**: Supports TLS transmission encryption and field-level storage encryption\n"
"- **Audit Logging**: Records all sensitive operations\n"
"- **Security Hardening**: Follows security best practices for configuration\n"
"\n"
"### 3.4 Extensibility\n"
"\n"
"- **Plugin Mechanism**: Supports hot-loading of functional plugins\n"
"- **API Versioning**: Supports backward-compatible API version management\n"
"- **Configuration Center**: Centralized management of dynamic configuration\n"
"- **Event-Driven**: Supports event-driven architecture extensions\n"
"\n"
"## 4. Deployment Architecture\n"
"\n"
"The system supports multiple deployment modes:\n"
"\n"
"| Deployment Mode | Applicable Scenario | Advantages |\n"
"|----------------|-------------------|-----------|\n"
"| Standalone Deployment | Development/Testing | Simple and easy to use |\n"
"| Cluster Deployment | Production Environment | High availability, elastic scaling |\n"
"| Containerized Deployment | Cloud Native | Rapid deployment, resource isolation |\n"
"| Hybrid Deployment | Complex Scenarios | Flexible combination, optimal resource utilization |\n"
"\n"
"## 5. Summary\n"
"\n"
"This architecture design fully considers the system's scalability, reliability, and maintainability. Through modular design and the decoupling of core features, it ensures the system can adapt to changing business needs while maintaining high performance and stability. Each module follows best practices in design and implementation, providing a solid foundation for the long-term evolution of the system.\n"

msgid "架构设计与核心特性"
msgstr "Architecture Design and Core Features"

msgid "1.逻辑架构"
msgstr "Logical Architecture"

msgid "![图像](./figures/architectural_diagram.png) **Triton-Ascend 架构说明**"
msgstr "![Image](./figures/architectural_diagram.png) **Triton-Ascend Architecture Description**"

msgid "图像"
msgstr "image"

msgid "**核心组件：**"
msgstr "**Core Components:**"

msgid "**`Ascend language extension`**：适配 Ascend 的 Triton 语言扩展"
msgstr "**`Ascend language extension`**: Triton language extension adapted for Ascend"

msgid "**`compiler`**：适配 Ascend 的 Triton 编译器"
msgstr "**`compiler`**: A Triton compiler adapted for Ascend."

msgid "**`driver`**：适配 Ascend 的设备驱动接口"
msgstr "**`driver`**: Device driver interface adapted for Ascend."

msgid "**组件功能：**"
msgstr "**Component Function:**"

msgid "**`Ascend language extension`** 在标准 Triton 语言基础上，引入针对 Ascend NPU 架构的语法与语义扩展。"
msgstr "**`Ascend language extension`** introduces syntax and semantic extensions tailored to the Ascend NPU architecture, building upon the standard Triton language."

msgid "**`compiler`** 接收来自上层 Triton compiler 生成的中间表示文件 `TTIR`（Triton IR），执行一系列适配昇腾硬件的转换。"
msgstr "**`compiler`** receives the intermediate representation file `TTIR` (Triton IR) generated by the upper-level Triton compiler and performs a series of transformations adapted to Ascend hardware."

msgid "Triton IR 转换为 Linalg IR，再经 BiSheng Compiler 生成面向 Ascend NPU 的可执行二进制文件  `triton_xxx_kernel.o`。"
msgstr "Triton IR is converted to Linalg IR, and then through BiSheng Compiler, an executable binary file `triton_xxx_kernel.o` targeting Ascend NPU is generated."

msgid "**`driver`** 提供 Triton 运行时与 Ascend 软件栈（CANN）之间的对接能力， 加载由 BiSheng Compiler 生成的设备侧可执行内核 `triton_xxx_kernel.o` 。"
msgstr "**`driver`** provides the interface capability between the Triton runtime and the Ascend software stack (CANN), loading the device-side executable kernel `triton_xxx_kernel.o` generated by the BiSheng Compiler."

msgid "2.代码结构"
msgstr "2. Code Structure"

msgid "2.1 代码结构原则"
msgstr "2.1 Code Structure Principles"

msgid "本项目在标准 Triton 基础上，扩展支持华为 Ascend NPU（通过 CANN 软件栈）。整体设计遵循以下**代码原则**："
msgstr "This project extends standard Triton to support Huawei Ascend NPU (via the CANN software stack). The overall design follows the following **code principles**:"

msgid "**若修改与目标硬件无关**（target independent），应保留在 **Triton core** 部分（如language、runtime的通用修改）；"
msgstr "**If the modification is target independent**, it should be kept in the **Triton core** section (e.g., general modifications to language, runtime)."

msgid "**若修改与 Ascend 硬件强相关**（target affinitive），应放在 **Triton-Ascend** 中。"
msgstr "**If the modification is strongly related to Ascend hardware** (target affinitive), it should be placed in **Triton-Ascend**."

msgid "2.2 目录结构与功能说明"
msgstr "2.2 Directory Structure and Functional Description"

