msgid "`python/`"
msgstr "python/"

msgid "Triton core"
msgstr "Triton core"

msgid "保留标准 Triton 的 Python 侧通用实现，包括 `triton.language`、JIT、运行时、缓存、工具链入口等。与硬件无关的通用能力优先放在该目录。"
msgstr "Retain the standard Triton Python-side generic implementation, including `triton.language`, JIT, runtime, caching, toolchain entry points, etc. Hardware-independent generic capabilities should be prioritized in this directory."

msgid "`include/` 和 `lib/`"
msgstr "`include/` and `lib/`"

msgid "保留标准 Triton 的通用 C++/MLIR 基础设施、Dialect、Pass 和转换逻辑。这里不承载 Ascend 专属后端实现。"
msgstr "Retain the general C++/MLIR infrastructure, Dialects, Passes, and conversion logic of standard Triton. This does not host Ascend-specific backend implementations."

msgid "`third_party/ascend/`"
msgstr "third_party/ascend/"

msgid "Triton-Ascend"
msgstr "Triton-Ascend"

msgid "Ascend 后端的根目录，集中放置与 Ascend NPU、CANN、BiSheng Compiler 强相关的语言扩展、编译后端、运行时驱动、MLIR Pass、示例和测试。"
msgstr "The root directory for the Ascend backend, centrally housing language extensions, compilation backends, runtime drivers, MLIR passes, examples, and tests that are strongly related to Ascend NPU, CANN, and BiSheng Compiler."

msgid "`third_party/ascend/language/`"
msgstr "`third_party/ascend/language/`"

msgid "Ascend language extension"
msgstr "Ascend language extension"

msgid "Ascend 语言扩展目录，安装后会链接到 `triton.language.extra` 下，供 Triton kernel 通过 `triton.language.extra.cann` 使用。"
msgstr "Ascend language extension directory, which will be linked to `triton.language.extra` after installation, for use by Triton kernels via `triton.language.extra.cann`."

msgid "`third_party/ascend/language/cann/libdevice.py`"
msgstr "`third_party/ascend/language/cann/libdevice.py`"

msgid "适配 Ascend NPU 的 `libdevice` Python 接口，提供数学函数和底层算子封装，供 Triton 算子调用。"
msgstr "The `libdevice` Python interface adapted for Ascend NPU, providing mathematical functions and low-level operator wrappers for invocation by Triton operators."

msgid "`third_party/ascend/backend/compiler.py`"
msgstr "`third_party/ascend/backend/compiler.py`"

msgid "compiler"
msgstr "compiler"

msgid "Ascend 编译器后端主入口，负责注册编译选项、组织 TTIR 到 Ascend 适配 IR、Linalg/LLVM 等阶段的转换，并调用后续工具链生成可执行二进制文件。"
msgstr "Ascend compiler backend main entry, responsible for registering compilation options, organizing the conversion of TTIR to Ascend adaptation IR, Linalg/LLVM and other stages, and invoking the downstream toolchain to generate executable binaries."

msgid "`third_party/ascend/backend/driver.py`"
msgstr "`third_party/ascend/backend/driver.py`"

msgid "driver"
msgstr "driver"

msgid "Ascend 运行时驱动模块，负责与 CANN/torch_npu 等运行时环境对接，加载并启动已编译的设备侧可执行文件。"
msgstr "Ascend runtime driver module, responsible for interfacing with runtime environments such as CANN/torch_npu, loading and launching compiled device-side executable files."

msgid "`third_party/ascend/include/` 和 `third_party/ascend/lib/`"
msgstr "`third_party/ascend/include/` and `third_party/ascend/lib/`"

msgid "Ascend 专属 MLIR Dialect、Pass 和转换实现，例如 `TritonToLinalg`、`TritonToStructured`、`DynamicCVPipeline`、`AutoBlockify` 等。"
msgstr "Ascend-specific MLIR Dialect, Pass, and conversion implementations, such as `TritonToLinalg`, `TritonToStructured`, `DynamicCVPipeline`, `AutoBlockify`, etc."

msgid "`third_party/ascend/AscendNPU-IR/`"
msgstr "`third_party/ascend/AscendNPU-IR/`"

msgid "Ascend NPU 相关 IR 与 BiSheng 编译链适配内容，是从 Triton-Ascend 编译流程继续下沉到硬件侧代码生成的重要组成部分。"
msgstr "The adaptation content of Ascend NPU-related IR and the BiSheng compilation chain is an important component that further sinks from the Triton-Ascend compilation flow to hardware-side code generation."

msgid "`third_party/ascend/tutorials/` 和 `third_party/ascend/unittest/`"
msgstr "`third_party/ascend/tutorials/` and `third_party/ascend/unittest/`"

msgid "示例与测试"
msgstr "Examples and Tests"

msgid "提供 Ascend 平台上的 Triton 示例、迁移样例、Python 单元测试和 MLIR 转换测试，用于验证 Ascend 后端能力。"
msgstr "Provides Triton examples, migration samples, Python unit tests, and MLIR conversion tests on the Ascend platform to validate Ascend backend capabilities."

